    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🚀 Built an AI-Powered Invoice Extraction Workflow with n8n\n\nExcited to share one of my latest automation projects!\n\nI built an AI-driven workflow that automatically extracts structured data from PDF invoices and saves every invoice item as a separate row in Google Sheets—eliminating manual data entry.\n\n🔄 Workflow\n\n📄 PDF Invoice\n⬇️\n📑 Extract Text from PDF\n⬇️\n🤖 AI Agent (Structured Output with JSON Schema)\n⬇️\n🔀 Split Out (Item-wise Processing)\n⬇️\n📊 Google Sheets\n\n✅ Automatically Extracts\nInvoice Number\nInvoice Date\nDue Date\nCustomer Name & Email\nVendor Name & Email\nProduct Description\nQuantity\nUnit Price\nLine Item Amount\nCurrency\nTotal Invoice Amount\n💡 Key Achievement\n\nInstead of storing the entire invoice in a single row, the workflow intelligently creates one Google Sheets row for each invoice item, making reporting, filtering, analytics, and accounting much more efficient.\n\n📈 Example Output\nInvoice\tProduct\tQty\tAmount\nINV-2026-0912\tDell Inspiron 15 3520\t1\t115,000 PKR\nINV-2026-0912\tLogitech MX Master 3S Wireless Mouse\t1\t18,500 PKR\nINV-2026-0912\tAnker 543 USB-C Hub\t2\t15,000 PKR\n🛠 Tech Stack\nn8n\nAI Agent\nJSON Schema (Structured Output)\nSplit Out Node\nGoogle Sheets\nPDF Extraction\n\nThis workflow can be adapted for invoice processing, bookkeeping, ERP systems, finance automation, and expense management.\n\nI'm continuously exploring how AI and workflow automation can eliminate repetitive tasks and improve business efficiency.\n\n#n8n #AIAutomation #WorkflowAutomation #ArtificialIntelligence #NoCode #Automation #GoogleSheets #InvoiceAutomation #BusinessAutomation #AIAgents",
        "height": 912,
        "width": 1952
      },
